  "protocol_note": "within = StratifiedKFold(5) per metal on the paper funnel, 5 split seeds; cross = ligand-disjoint leave-one-metal-out, source-trained model scored zero-shot on the held-out metal, 10 seeds x K in {5,10,20}.  Two disclosed protocol differences from the chemprop reference this migrates (l3_kshot_pf_k40): (1) that reference used a single K=40 for the cross column, while the in-house fsma_l1_ep50 run sweeps K in {5,10,20} -- the cross column here is the mean over all (seed, K) cells, with the per-K breakdown kept under cross_per_k; the K choice moves each metal by <= 0.002.  (2) The chemprop backbone used d_h=300 and ten seeds; the in-house run uses hidden=128 and five within split seeds.  These budget/capacity differences are disclosed, not hidden.",
